    "updated_at": "2026-06-08T13:51:23Z",
    "body": "Please reduce the number of options down from 132 to something more like 10-15. Marking availability can require up to 3 clicks meaning this form requires somewhere between 140-400 clicks to fill in, depending on availability.\n\nIt might also be worthwhile not adding any meetings this week, to allow participants time to fill it out. \n\nAlso, specifically to next week - many WHATWG participants will likely be unavailable due to [Web Engines Hackfest](https://webengineshackfest.org/).\n\nMy recommendation is to pick 3 suitable time slots for each day across 22nd-26th June",
